+# Multi-agent worker delivery — 2026-11-17
+
+Implementation worktree: `/home/jkern/dev/aq-platform/wt/multi-agent-node-worker`.
+Original checkout branch: `feat/multi-agent-node`; wire baseline now `fb9f19d` (the vendor
+owner added it independently after the initial `d30c933` handoff).
+
+## Delivery commits
+
+The sandbox cannot write the checkout's shared Git metadata:
+`/home/jkern/dev/aq-platform/aq-worker/.git/worktrees/multi-agent-node-worker/index.lock`
+returns **Read-only file system**. The actual checkout branch has not been advanced by this
+implementation. Logical commits are instead preserved on `feat/multi-agent-node` in
+`target/delivery.git`, with its index at `target/delivery.index`, all inside this worktree.
+The exported `handoff/multi-agent-worker.bundle` and `handoff/patches/` carry them for import.
+No push was attempted. No protocol/vendor path is changed by these delivery commits.
+
+- `80c9920a5138c6dc72db2de7b799dae42fe9dd30` — feat(worker): run isolated agent slots beneath each enrolled node
+- `84ed263` — feat(packaging): preserve enrolled nodes and configure agent capacity remotely
+- `3ec1755` — test(worker): fence late terminal receipts between same-boot agent slots
+- A final documentation commit records this verification report and the completed handoff.
+
+The shared external handoff file also returns **Read-only file system**. The versioned
+`handoff/multi-agent-worker.md` and `handoff/open-contract-questions.md` here are the updated
+copies; the external originals were read fully but could not be updated.
